[
  {
    "op": "replace",
    "path": "/displayConfig/title",
    "raw": "Humped by a Deep One",
    "value": "沉溺深潜者之中"
  },
  {
    "op": "replace",
    "path": "/displayConfig/subtitle",
    "raw": "A sickening, creepy love epic",
    "value": "一部令人作呕、毛骨悚然的爱情史诗"
  },
  {
    "op": "replace",
    "path": "/scenes/pre_credits/text",
    "raw": "[This appears to be a journal, written by one C.C Wagner. The cover is blood-stained, ruining the once meticulously tidy book. Mostly, it's boring entries detailing nothing interesting. Sample data, climate experiments...]",
    "value": "[这似乎是一本日记，由一位名叫C.C.瓦格纳的人所写。封面沾有血迹，破坏了原本精心打理的书本外观。内容大多是枯燥的条目，记录着无趣的日常：样本数据、气候实验...]"
  },
  {
    "op": "replace",
    "path": "/scenes/intro0/text",
    "raw": "[...and then you find the juicy bits. Near the end of the book, scrawled in a more hasty hand (yes, they actually wrote on real live paper instead of digital!) a number of entries are found that are quite unsettling.]",
    "value": "[...接着，你发现了那些引人入胜的细节。在书的末尾，有几处匆忙写下的记录（没错，他们是真的写在实实在在的纸上，而非数字设备上！），读来令人颇为不安。]"
  },
  {
    "op": "replace",
    "path": "/scenes/intro1a/text",
    "raw": "Jun 4 - Something in the ice",
    "value": "6月4日 - 冰封之物"
  },
  {
    "op": "replace",
    "path": "/scenes/intro1/text",
    "raw": "The driller fell through the damned ice! The entire thing is lost, utterly unsalvagable without some means to block the effects of the liquid nitrogen pool. And that still doesn't help lug the thing out.",
    "value": "司钻掉进了该死的冰层！如果没有办法阻隔液氮池的影响，整个钻探设备就彻底报废了，完全无法抢救。可即便解决了液氮问题，我们还是没法把那玩意儿拖出来。"
  },
  {
    "op": "replace",
    "path": "/scenes/intro2/text",
    "raw": "We found some sort of corpse in the ice. I can't even discern what it is. Never seen anything like it. It's like a chimera of lifeforms. Terrifying to behold. I'm going to bring it to MacReady to autopsy.",
    "value": "我们在冰层里发现了一具尸体，完全辨认不出是什么东西。从未见过这样的生物，简直像是多种生命体的嵌合体。看着就让人毛骨悚然。我打算把它带给麦克瑞迪做解剖分析。"
  },
  {
    "op": "replace",
    "path": "/scenes/intro3/text",
    "raw": "Jun 5 - Changes",
    "value": "6月5日-转变"
  },
  {
    "op": "replace",
    "path": "/scenes/intro3c/text",
    "raw": "MacReady has been acting strange lately. I can't place my finger on it, but ever since that...thing...fell under his operating knife he's changed. It's unsettling.",
    "value": "麦克雷迪最近举止怪异。我说不清具体从何时开始，但自打那...东西...在他的手术刀下被剖开之后，他就变了。这令人不安。"
  },
  {
    "op": "replace",
    "path": "/scenes/intro3a/text",
    "raw": "Actually, I think it may be in the eyes. It's almost as if he sees you and...knows you. Knows you in ways he shouldn't. He remarked on Doakes's sordid past, and he wasn't there.",
    "value": "实际上，我觉得问题可能出在他的眼神里。他看你的样子，就好像...能看透你。以一种本不该有的方式了解你。他提到了多克斯不堪的过去，可当时他并不在场。"
  },
  {
    "op": "replace",
    "path": "/scenes/intro3b/text",
    "raw": "Jun 6 - Confinement",
    "value": "6月6日-禁闭"
  },
  {
    "op": "replace",
    "path": "/scenes/intro4/text",
    "raw": "We found one of the dogs this morning. It had been strung up and vivisected. Its organs were in a neat pile beside it on the floor, stacked to resemble that malign aberration I found.",
    "value": "今天早上我们发现了一只狗。它被吊起并实施了活体解剖，器官整整齐齐堆在身旁地板上，排列方式竟与我们之前发现的那个恶性变异体如出一辙。"
  },
  {
    "op": "replace",
    "path": "/scenes/intro5/text",
    "raw": "We've confined MacReady to the labs. He's totally lost it. At least we can seal the door remotely and he can be holed up with that...thing. I should investigate beyond the cliffs...see what is going on.",
    "value": "目前我们已将麦克雷迪禁闭在实验室内。他已完全失控。至少我们可以远程封住门，让他和那个...东西困在一起。我得去悬崖那边探查一下...看看究竟发生了什么。"
  },
  {
    "op": "replace",
    "path": "/scenes/intro6/text",
    "raw": "I'm taking the first rover tomorrow morning, and leaving the second for the rest should I fail to return. At least then they can still escape. Now we just need to hope for some damned answers. I'm starting to lose it.",
    "value": "明天一早我就驾驶第一辆漫游车出发，如果我没能回来，第二辆就留给其他人。至少这样他们还有机会逃离。现在，我们只能寄希望于那些该死的答案了。我快要撑不住了。"
  },
  {
    "op": "replace",
    "path": "/scenes/intro7/text",
    "raw": "Jun 9 - Tacos are nutritious",
    "value": "6月9日-玉米饼很有营养"
  },
  {
    "op": "replace",
    "path": "/scenes/intro8/text",
    "raw": "The find I have just made rewrites the knowledge of the cosmos in its entirety. There are ruins past the mountain. It was a treacherous climb but well worth it. This place is ancient beyond telling.",
    "value": "山峦另一侧的发现彻底颠覆了我对宇宙的认知。那是一座险峻而陡峭的山峰，攀登异常艰难，却终究值得。此地古老得难以言喻。"
  },
  {
    "op": "replace",
    "path": "/scenes/intro9/text",
    "raw": "These ruins match no known species, language or style I am aware of. Something about them is wrong, though. The angles are just...off. Dimensions seem larger or smaller than they should. My mind is cracking.",
    "value": "此处的建筑风格、铭文与壁画，与任何已知文明皆不相符。它们的存在本身便违背常理，结构的角度扭曲异常，维度时大时小。我的思维正在崩溃。"
  },
  {
    "op": "replace",
    "path": "/scenes/intro10/text",
    "raw": "My vision slowly returns to me, and I feel warm sand beneath my hands and feet. Am I on a planet's surface? Is that the sun I feel upon me, or perhaps I am merely on fire?",
    "value": "我的视线逐渐清晰，手与脚底传来温热的沙粒触感。我这是身处某颗星球的地表吗？那照耀着我的，究竟是真实的太阳，还是我自身在燃烧的错觉？"
  },
  {
    "op": "replace",
    "path": "/scenes/intro11/text",
    "raw": "I am not on fire, but that doesn't give me much reassurance. The place I am in is almost entirely unfamiliar.",
    "value": "我并未身处火海，但这并未让我感到多少安心。眼前的一切几乎完全陌生。"
  },
  {
    "op": "replace",
    "path": "/scenes/intro12/text",
    "raw": "I am on the shore of a small island, in the center of which is a grand pagoda. A sun sets above me. It is clear to me that I must plan my next move very carefully...",
    "value": "我站在一座小岛的岸边，岛中央矗立着一座宏伟的宝塔。夕阳在我头顶缓缓沉落。我清楚地意识到，必须审慎规划下一步的行动..."
  },
  {
    "op": "replace",
    "path": "/scenes/sneak1/text",
    "raw": "An unfamiliar land, a pounding headache... I decide to approach this situation with stealth. I crouch low, making my way across the beach towards the pagoda.",
    "value": "陌生的土地，剧烈的头痛...我决定悄然应对。我压低身子，沿着海滩匍匐前进，朝那座塔楼靠近。"
  },
  {
    "op": "replace",
    "path": "/scenes/sneak2/text",
    "raw": "The air is quiet, except for the soft lapping of waves on this mysterious beach. The ocean appears to be water, and not acid or magma. This fact calms me somewhat.",
    "value": "空气静谧，唯有神秘海滩上轻柔的浪花拍岸声。眼前的大海是澄澈的水体，而非酸液或熔岩，这让我稍感安心。"
  },
  {
    "op": "replace",
    "path": "/scenes/sneak3/text",
    "raw": "I hear voices! I hide behind a nearby post. The architecture is all Hylotl, so at least my chances of being in Floran territory seems low.",
    "value": "我听到声音了！我赶紧躲到旁边一根柱子后面。这里的建筑风格全是鲛族的，看来我身处叶族领地的可能性应该不大。"
  },
  {
    "op": "replace",
    "path": "/scenes/sneak4/text",
    "raw": "Outside the entrance to the pagoda, I see a girl, kneeling in the sand. I gasp, unable to steel myself, and she turns to see me!",
    "value": "塔门外，我看见一个女孩跪在沙地上。我倒吸一口气，无法镇定心神，而她恰好转身，与我四目相对！"
  },
  {
    "op": "replace",
    "path": "/scenes/yell1/text",
    "raw": "I panic and start yelling. I'm sure I will draw the attention of a helpful authority figure who will help me in my predicament.",
    "value": "我惊慌失措，开始大喊大叫。我确信这会引起一位乐于助人的权威人士的注意，他会帮我摆脱困境。"
  },
  {
    "op": "replace",
    "path": "/scenes/yell2/text",
    "raw": "However, who instead greets me is a beautiful girl, dressed in strange ceremonial robes. Grasped in her hands is a pink staff.",
    "value": "然而，迎接我的却是一位身着奇异礼袍的美丽少女，她手中紧握着一根粉色的法杖。"
  },
  {
    "op": "replace",
    "path": "/scenes/kasumi1a/text",
    "raw": "\"Who are you, and why are you sneaking around?\" says the girl, light dancing off her beautiful, clammy skin.",
    "value": "“你是谁，鬼鬼祟祟地在这里做什么？”那个女孩说道，她那湿漉漉的美丽皮肤上的光芒在翩翩起舞"
  },
  {
    "op": "replace",
    "path": "/scenes/kasumi1b/text",
    "raw": "\"Who are you, and why are you screaming like a nerd?\" says the girl, light dancing off her beautiful, clammy skin.",
    "value": "“你是谁，为什么像个呆子一样尖叫？”那个女孩说道，她那湿漉漉的美丽皮肤上的光芒在翩翩起舞"
  },
  {
    "op": "replace",
    "path": "/scenes/explanation1a/text",
    "raw": "\"You're at the Grand Hylotl Library, which is opening one week from tonight.\" She explains.",
    "value": "“你正身处大塔图书馆，它将于今晚起一周后正式开放。”她解释到。"
  },
  {
    "op": "replace",
    "path": "/scenes/explanation2a/text",
    "raw": "\"No-one else is supposed to be here whilst I bless the island! Why did you come here?\"",
    "value": "“在我为这座岛屿祈福时，本不该有旁人在场！你为何会来此地？”"
  },
  {
    "op": "replace",
    "path": "/scenes/explanation1b/text",
    "raw": "\"I am Kasumi, a shrine maiden sent to bless the Grand Hylotl Library before its opening next week.\" She explains.",
    "value": "“我是霞，一名被派来为即将在下周开放的大塔图书馆祈福的巫女。”她说道。"
  },
  {
    "op": "replace",
    "path": "/scenes/explanation2b/text",
    "raw": "\"No-one else is supposed to be here, though! Why did you come here?\"",
    "value": "“这里应该没有别人啊！你怎么会来这里？”"
  },
  {
    "op": "replace",
    "path": "/scenes/question_beauty1/text",
    "raw": "She is taken aback by the abruptness of my statement. I panic, wondering why that would be one of the first things I would say to a girl.",
    "value": "她被我这突如其来的话语惊得愣住了。我心中一阵慌乱，不明白为何会对一个女孩说出这样的话作为开场白。"
  },
  {
    "op": "replace",
    "path": "/scenes/question_beauty2/text",
    "raw": "She replies, \"Well I'm afraid you've come to the wrong place, because the Grand Hylotl Library isn't open to the public just yet.\"",
    "value": "她回答道：“恐怕您来错地方了，因为宏伟的大塔图书馆目前尚未对公众开放。”"
  },
  {
    "op": "replace",
    "path": "/scenes/question_beauty3/text",
    "raw": " I assume that she misunderstood the implication of my remark, but I cannot help stare a little too long into her triumvirate of ruby red eyes.",
    "value": "我猜她是误解了我话里的意思，但我还是忍不住久久凝视着她那三颗如红宝石般的眼睛。"
  },
  {
    "op": "replace",
    "path": "/scenes/question_beauty4a/text",
    "raw": "\"Where are my manners,\" she adds suddenly, \"I forgot to ask you your name. Who are you?\"",
    "value": "“我真是太失礼了，”她突然补充道，“都忘了问你的名字。你是谁？”"
  },
  {
    "op": "replace",
    "path": "/scenes/question_beauty4b/text",
    "raw": "\"Where are my manners,\" she adds suddenly, \"My name is Kasumi. And who might you be?\"",
    "value": "“我真是太失礼了，”她突然补充道，“我叫霞。请问你怎么称呼？”"
  },
  {
    "op": "replace",
    "path": "/scenes/question_beauty5a/text",
    "raw": "\"...That's a weird name,\" she says flatly. \"Why would your parents even call you that?\"",
    "value": "“这名字真怪，”她语气平淡地说，“你父母怎么会给你起这样的名字？”"
  },
  {
    "op": "replace",
    "path": "/scenes/question_beauty5b/text",
    "raw": "\"It's a pleasure to meet you, Vaughn St. Lovecastle!\" she says with a pleasant smile. \"Why are you interested in this unopened library, of all places?\"",
    "value": "“很高兴见到你，沃恩·圣·爱城堡！”她带着愉快的微笑说道。“在所有地方中，你为什么偏偏对这个尚未开放的图书馆感兴趣呢？”"
  },
  {
    "op": "replace",
    "path": "/scenes/question_beauty6a/text",
    "raw": "I tersely avoid the subject of my name's embarassing origin.",
    "value": "我简明扼要地回避了“我的名字令人尴尬的起源”的话题。"
  },
  {
    "op": "replace",
    "path": "/scenes/question_beauty6b/text",
    "raw": "\"So tell me,\" she begins, \" Why are you interested in this unopened library, of all places?\"",
    "value": "“那么，告诉我”。她说，“在这么多地方之中你为什么只对这座未开馆的图书馆感兴趣呢？”"
  },
  {
    "op": "replace",
    "path": "/scenes/question_time1/text",
    "raw": "\"Travelled... Through time?\" she repeats, confused. \"But doesn't everyone travel through time?\"",
    "value": "“穿越...时间？”她困惑地重复道，“但每个人不都在时间中前行吗？”"
  },
  {
    "op": "replace",
    "path": "/scenes/question_time2/text",
    "raw": "I ask her what she means.",
    "value": "我问她是什么意思。"
  },
  {
    "op": "replace",
    "path": "/scenes/question_time3/text",
    "raw": "\"We're all moving through time, at a rate of around 1 second per second.\" she elaborates.",
    "value": "“我们都在时间里穿行，速度大约是每秒一秒。”她进一步解释道。"
  },
  {
    "op": "replace",
    "path": "/scenes/question_time4/text",
    "raw": "I cannot tell if this beautiful girl is a genius or insane.",
    "value": "我无法判断这位美丽的女孩是天才还是疯子。"
  },
  {
    "op": "replace",
    "path": "/scenes/pagoda1/text",
    "raw": "The library... The Grand Hylotl Library!",
    "value": "噢，这里是图书馆...鲛人的大塔图书馆！"
  },
  {
    "op": "replace",
    "path": "/scenes/pagoda2/text",
    "raw": "Of course I've heard of it, it is a famous historical site, yet right now it hasn't even opened yet! THAT is why I knew I have been sent to the past!",
    "value": "当然我听说过它，它是一个著名的历史遗址，但直到现在它也还没有开放！这就是为什么我知道我已经被送到了过去的原因！"
  },
  {
    "op": "replace",
    "path": "/scenes/pagoda3/text",
    "raw": "I quickly explain to Kasumi that in my era, the library is open.",
    "value": "我很快地向霞解释，在我的时代，图书馆是开放的。"
  },
  {
    "op": "replace",
    "path": "/scenes/pagoda4a/text",
    "raw": "\"Your story is far-fetched, Mr. Lovecastle,\" she begins, \"But you don't look or talk like anyone I've ever known. Perhaps your story is true.\"",
    "value": "“你说的话很牵强，爱城堡先生”她说，“但你看起来不像我认识的任何人，可能你说的是真的。”"
  },
  {
    "op": "replace",
    "path": "/scenes/pagoda4b/text",
    "raw": "\"Your story sounds insane,\" she begins, \"But you don't look or talk like anyone I've ever known. Perhaps your story is true.\"",
    "value": "“你说的话很疯狂，”她说，“但你看起来不像我认识的任何人，可能你说的是真的。”"
  },
  {
    "op": "replace",
    "path": "/scenes/pagoda5/text",
    "raw": "\"If you have been sent through time and space at an unusual rate, what do you think caused you to come here?\"",
    "value": "“如果你以不寻常的速度穿越时空，那你又认为是什么导致你来到这里？”"
  },
  {
    "op": "replace",
    "path": "/scenes/hockey1/text",
    "raw": "\"Air Hockey? What is this 'Air Hockey'? you speak of?\"",
    "value": "“空气曲棍球？这是什么意思？”"
  },
  {
    "op": "replace",
    "path": "/scenes/hockey2/text",
    "raw": "...",
    "value": "..."
  },
  {
    "op": "replace",
    "path": "/scenes/hockey3/text",
    "raw": "She doesn't know what Air Hockey is.",
    "value": "她不知道什么是空中曲棍球。"
  },
  {
    "op": "replace",
    "path": "/scenes/hockey4/text",
    "raw": "There probably isn't even any Air Hockey IN this era.",
    "value": "在那个年代，或许连空气曲棍球都还没有。"
  },
  {
    "op": "replace",
    "path": "/scenes/hockey5/text",
    "raw": "I suddenly feel the crushing weight of how serious my circumstances have become.",
    "value": "我突然感到我的处境变得多么糟糕，压得我喘不过气来。"
  },
  {
    "op": "replace",
    "path": "/scenes/hockey6/text",
    "raw": "\"Does this 'Air Hockey' of yours usually send people through time?\"",
    "value": "“你说的‘曲棍球’，别人是不是都喜欢玩这个？”"
  },
  {
    "op": "replace",
    "path": "/scenes/hockey7/text",
    "raw": "\"Perhaps it was something else?\" she says thoughtfully..",
    "value": "“可能是什么别的东西？”她若有所思..."
  },
  {
    "op": "replace",
    "path": "/scenes/hockey8/text",
    "raw": "She ignores me entirely, contemplating for a moment before her face lights up.",
    "value": "她完全无视我，沉思了片刻，然后她的脸亮了起来。"
  },
  {
    "op": "replace",
    "path": "/scenes/ritual1/text",
    "raw": "\"The ceremony!\" she exclaims. \"But it is a ceremony of tradition, not divine power. And it is not even finished, either.\"",
    "value": "“真可爱，他们在哪里相见的？”"
  },
  {
    "op": "replace",
    "path": "/scenes/ritual2a/text",
    "raw": "I ask her why her ceremony wasn't complete.",
    "value": "我问她为什么庆典没有完成。"
  },
  {
    "op": "replace",
    "path": "/scenes/ritual3a/text",
    "raw": "\"Well of course it isn't - I was interrupted by you flailing about and screaming for help.\"",
    "value": "“当然不是，我被你的手忙脚乱大叫着求助打断了”"
  },
  {
    "op": "replace",
    "path": "/scenes/ritual2b/text",
    "raw": "I ask her why her ceremony wasn't complete.",
    "value": "我问她为什么庆典没有完成。"
  },
  {
    "op": "replace",
    "path": "/scenes/ritual3b/text",
    "raw": "\"Well of course it isn't - I was interrupted by you flailing about screaming for help.\"",
    "value": "“当然不是，我被你的手忙脚乱大叫着求助打断了”"
  },
  {
    "op": "replace",
    "path": "/scenes/ritual4/text",
    "raw": "\"But perhaps...\" she says whilst looking intently at the staff in her hand, \"Perhaps finishing the ceremony will help send you back?\"",
    "value": "“不过...”，她把注意力集中于她手中的法杖上说道，“或许这个仪式可以帮助你返回你的世界。”"
  },
  {
